{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Bound configured timeouts to `threading.TIMEOUT_MAX`.** `WorkflowInsightConfig` still accepts finite floats above the platform wait limit, so a blocked exporter makes `Event.wait()` raise `OverflowError`. The plugin then skips lane shutdown and execution-state cleanup. Reject or clamp oversized values, convert huge integers without leaking `OverflowError` from `math.isfinite`, and add a blocked-exporter regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7sK4dB","finding_digest":"2bcc1f7718332773d7a0d705fd13418df1203adcb2afe8f2045ca84d9cb465a1","finding_id":"arf_v1_fpgb65yygmtxhv5a24c72e2brx","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_flushbarrier.wait::unsupported-timeout-range","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_flushbarrier.wait::unsupported-timeout-range","line":80,"observation_digest":"049e77354cb172334872fd01291ee6cad247619c70f414d02b7b2f4c01294327","observation_id":"aro_v1_asphonkmwfzdgsds7uasshxgzl","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_fpgb65yygmtxhv5a24c72e2brx","published_at":"2026-09-08T21:09:43Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6jnifbi3l5kkwf6feew3hw67hz","reviewed_base_sha":"b7b10c7f5640615a4974b793b7618dfb4a37a59b","reviewed_head_sha":"2e81513927cad0f0d7ee3440e4336cd9b4be0dd3","reviewer":"codex","start_line":80,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_a63o5hwlik522nfulwyape4msc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T21:09:43Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
